            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.17+2SA.6.18+2SA.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 6:17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kitolomut asaduku naka Edeke, kibwaikis ŋes kidin owema loebubukinit Daudi kanuke: koinakis ainakineta nuieweio ka ainakineta nuka ainapakin kakonyen nuka Edeke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau Daudi ainakin ainakinet naicweio ka ainakineta nuka ainapakin, kilipak ituŋa arereŋ kokiror loka EJAKAIT, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokorak da ninitunanan yenika Isirael, ikiliok ka aŋor, ninidiopet emugati, aturosit naka akiriŋ, ka aluŋuret naka imusabibun lukeokito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koseu ice luka Ilebin aiiaanakin koinaren kasaduku naka EJAKAIT, ainakin asuban ka aimal ka aiturit EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asap lokapolon, kotupite ŋes Sekaria, Yeiel, ka Semiramot, ka Yekiel, ka Matitia, ka Eliab, ka Benaia, ka Obed-edom, ka Yeiel, keiaas kisabulin ka adeudeun; ka Asap keiaas kikacwi, aituru kes; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka Benaia ka Yakasiel isasedotin kejaas karupepen tiritir, koinaren kasaduku naka aitutuket naka Edeke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
